  {
   "name": "bind_world",
   "comment": "recognise a world -> mint a WorldBinding + the six universal role slots (controllable_locus/affordance_effect/value_signal/dynamics/terminal/goal). Game is data; this names no game-noun. Single-fire via world.has_binding.",
